# Google Gemini API Configuration
# Get your API key at: https://ai.google.dev/

# Required: Your Gemini API Key
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Instructions:
# 1. Visit https://ai.google.dev/
# 2. Click "Get API Key" and sign in with Google
# 3. Create a new API key
# 4. Copy this file to .env.local: cp .env.local.example .env.local
# 5. Replace "your_gemini_api_key_here" with your actual API key
# 6. Restart your development server

# Note: Free tier includes 15 requests/minute and 1500 requests/day
# This is sufficient for most development and small production use cases
